BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 556.39 Tm (- Latency vs game speed. Gates close in seconds; Jev RTT is often hundreds of ms. Mitigation: state) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 543.89 Tm (projection + stale discard ? projection is approximate, not a full simulator inside Jev.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 531.39 Tm (- Binary, myopic action space. Only flap/wait for the current opening. No multi-gate planning,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 518.89 Tm (thrust magnitude, or continuous control.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 506.39 Tm (- Prompted heuristics in the loop. ifYouWait / oneFlap / criteria are app-authored summaries.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 493.89 Tm (Results partly reflect prompt engineering, not raw pixel perception.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 481.39 Tm (- No visual perception. Jev never sees the canvas ? only derived numbers + natural language.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 468.89 Tm (Feature extraction errors become model errors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 456.39 Tm (- Fallback opacity vs truthfulness. Timeouts use heuristic/local backup so the drone keeps flying.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 443.89 Tm (UI must label fallback, or demos overclaim "Jev flew.") Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 431.39 Tm (- Non-determinism and eval hardness. Same state can yield different choices; live score is a noisy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 418.89 Tm (KPI. Replay/benchmark tooling helps.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 406.39 Tm (- Stale-discard tradeoff. Aggressive discard avoids late ceiling flaps, but throws away expensive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 393.89 Tm (answers and can under-control under high latency.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 0.420 0.170 0.070 rg 1 0 0 1 52.00 381.39 Tm (- Scope boundary. This is a lab demo of structured real-time decisions ? not production autonomy or) Tj ET
